s between them.”)&nbsp;<a href="https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1057/palgrave.jdm.3240049.pdf" data-mark="link">[5]</a>. Однако, мы можем пойти дальше, обозначив каждую вещь — ассоциацией или связью, и задать для этого прочный формальный фундамент, о чём и будет эта статья.</p></div></div><div class="node node__padded node_heading node-condensed heading-element node_heading-2" style="white-space: normal;" data-node-view-wrapper=""><div class="node__drag-control" contenteditable="false" data-drag-handle="" draggable="true"><svg class="svg-icon" fill="currentColor" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M9 17c1.1046 0 2 .8954 2 2s-.8954 2-2 2-2-.8954-2-2 .8954-2 2-2m6 0c1.1046 0 2 .8954 2 2s-.8954 2-2 2-2-.8954-2-2 .8954-2 2-2m-6-7c1.1046 0 2 .8954 2 2s-.8954 2-2 2-2-.8954-2-2 .8954-2 2-2m6 0c1.1046 0 2 .8954 2 2s-.8954 2-2 2-2-.8954-2-2 .8954-2 2-2M9 3c1.1046 0 2 .8954 2 2s-.8954 2-2 2-2-.8954-2-2 .8954-2 2-2m6 0c1.1046 0 2 .8954 2 2s-.8954 2-2 2-2-.8954-2-2 .8954-2 2-2"></path></svg></div><div class="right-menu__container" contenteditable="false"><button class="node__dots button-icon" type="button"><svg class="svg-icon" fill="currentColor" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M5 10c1.1046 0 2 .8954 2 2s-.8954 2-2 2-2-.8954-2-2 .8954-2 2-2m7 0c1.1046 0 2 .8954 2 2s-.8954 2-2 2-2-.8954-2-2 .8954-2 2-2m7 0c1.1046 0 2 .8954 2 2s-.8954 2-2 2-2-.8954-2-2 .8954-2 2-2"></path></svg></button><div class="context-menu right-menu" contenteditable="false" style="display: none;"><div class="context-menu__wrapper"><button class="context-menu__item right-menu__item" data-item-type="delete-node" type="button"><svg class="svg-icon" fill="currentColor" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M17 8H7v11c0 .5523.4477 1 1 1h8c.5523 0 1-.4477 1-1zm-8 8v-4c0-.5523.4477-1 1-1s1 .4477 1 1v4c0 .5523-.4477 1-1 1s-1-.4477-1-1m4 0v-4c0-.5523.4477-1 1-1s1 .4477 1 1v4c0 .5523-.4477 1-1 1s-1-.4477-1-1m2-11c0-.5523-.4477-1-1-1h-4c-.5523 0-1 .4477-1 1v